    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Product URL to UGC Ad\n\n**Product URL to UGC Ad** visits a live product page, writes a spoken creator hook, and renders a lip-synced vertical ad.\n\n1. **Product URL** and **Creator Persona** feed into **Agent** (with browser access) to extract product claims and draft a 15-second spoken script.\n2. **TextToSpeech** and **Normalize** produce the voice track while **ImageToVideo** animates the **Creator Photo**.\n3. **LipSync** locks the creator's mouth movements to the spoken script."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": -220
        },
        "width": 720,
        "height": 180
      },
      {
        "id": "product_url",
        "type": "nodetool.input.StringInput",
        "data": {
          "name": "product_url",
          "value": "https://nodetool.ai",
          "description": "Landing page or store URL for the product being advertised.",
          "line_mode": "single_line"
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 40
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "persona",
        "type": "nodetool.input.StringInput",
        "data": {
          "name": "creator_persona",
          "value": "Handheld vertical phone video of a warm, direct creator speaking naturally to camera in a sunlit apartment",
          "description": "Delivery style and camera framing for the creator.",
          "line_mode": "multi_line"
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 80,
          "y": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "creator_photo",
        "type": "nodetool.input.ImageInput",
        "data": {
          "name": "creator_photo",
          "value": {
            "type": "image",
            "uri": "package://nodetool-base/recipe-inputs/ugc-creator-reference.png",
            "asset_id": null,
            "data": null,
            "metadata": null
          },
          "description": "Portrait photo of the spokesperson or creator."
