          "template": "Open {{ url }} and read the product headline, core benefits, and pricing or proof points.\n\nWrite a 15-second spoken UGC ad script (35 to 42 words) matching this persona: {{ persona }}.\n\nReturn ONLY the spoken lines — no stage directions, no quotation marks, no headings."
        },
        "position": {
          "x": 380,
          "y": 80
        }
      },
